feat 1.0

# ADR-0027 with ADR-0021: a capture reference inside `not` names a service like any other, so `not @ghostStore[0].id` is UNKNOWN_SERVICE_KEY, listing the configured services.

spec SPEC-BAD-022 "Unknown capture-reference service inside not"
context Bad
aggregate Thing
type command
status draft

construct:
  handler at src/do-thing.ts
  touches src/**

enforce:
  do the thing

contract:
  input ThingInput
  response ThingResult
  record ThingRow

scenario "does the thing":
  when: DoThing { value: 1 }
  predict success:
    response OK ThingResult
    eventStore has [ Wrote with ThingRow { ref: not @ghostStore[0].id } ]
